{"v":4,"catch":"射中兩個球！\n一個引導球的益智遊戲！","desc":"在這個遊戲中有三種模式。\n根據規則將球擲向球門。\n準確地排列準備好的方塊和物體，並將球引導至目標。\n從頭到尾找到最佳路線。\n\n遊戲模式\n\n■2個球\n同時滾動兩個球，使它們達到目標。\n請準確排列方塊和物體。\n\n■1個球\n確保只有一個球停在球門上。\n請準確排列方塊和物體。\n\n■時差2個球\n確保兩個球命中球門。\n請調整兩個球的開始時間。","publisher":"STARSIGN","release":"2021-04-22","genres":["街機","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0ebc6e6011e8e5ddbd633126d6102c5cd7075cea836c2039378ff54a97661c3d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/97fede51b66acfd4887e30726480bbe62e75724b7495730bd3302c00e78da671.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e96ee1e31ae3956dd7361958244634cd25fea2136a93ea4fe1c6000d2972fac8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a84a17e534652a94b4a04680f86eee11cfda27840a4b571c056591db8df43fd5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/616b1cf6b56fcb51c48e3e807a0eaffa94e424aeb2476b6485d717ca59c7e7c4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c8625bc4387dd3b91cc43f06ca52208a14223c46e95757f1e49e2ee62afeddca.jpg"],"titleId":"01009e700eea6000","dlc":[]}